OL,3,GNEWSAResidents disgusted by fly-tipping
OL,4,A'free for all'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Jackson, public protection manager
OL,7,Fat City of Lincoln Council, said: "This
OL,8,Fillegal fly-tipping incident is both
OL,9,Fdeeply disappointing and completely
OL,10,Funacceptable."
